hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2884","###
 Narrated to us Muhammad bin Bashshar, narrated to us Yahya, on the authority of Ibn Jurayj. And also narrated to us Muhammad bin Ma'mar, narrated to us Muhammad, who informed us that Ibn Jurayj said: Abdullah, the freed slave of Asma', narrated to me that Asma' (RA) descended on the night of Jam' (the gathering at Muzdalifah) at the house of Muzdalifah. She stood up to pray and said, ""O my son, stand and see"
